        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present this superb Two -bedroom, first floor apartment ideally located in this highly sought-after and gated development in Smithfield, Dublin 7.\n\nRichmond Square is a quiet and gated development ideally located on Morning Star Avenue in Dublin 7, within easy walking distance of Smithfield, Stoneybatter, TU Dublin Grangegorman, Phoenix Park and the City Centre. Surrounded by an abundance of cafes, bars, and restaurants, the Lighthouse Cinema and Jameson Visitor Centre all within walking distance, as are The Four Courts, Law Library, and all amenities of Dublin's City Centre. The Red Line Luas provides excellent connectivity, offering convenient access to Dublin City Centre and the IFSC in one direction, and to Heuston Station, St. James's Hospital and Tallaght in the other. The Grangegorman Green Line Luas stop is also just a few minutes' walk away, providing easy access to many parts of South Dublin. In addition, numerous bus routes operate from nearby Arran Quay, further enhancing transport links across the city.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 56 sqm comprises entrance hallway with hot press storage closet, open plan living room/kitchen with access to a private balcony, two generous double bedrooms with built in wardrobes and a tiled bathroom with bath and shower.  No 13 is coming to the market in excellent condition throughout and benefits a private balcony off the living room, light filled interior, floor to ceiling windows, lift access, being in a gated development and a designated underground parking space.\nAn opportunity not to be missed; Contact the agent at our Northside office on 01-6995050 or 086-0469458 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 56 sq.m</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>2 Bed 1 Bath</li>\n <li>1st Floor Apartment</li>\n <li>Light filled interior</li>\n <li>Floor to ceiling windows</li>\n <li>Designated underground parking space</li>\n <li>Private Balcony</li>\n <li>Lift access</li>\n <li>Overlooking a quiet internal courtyard</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Excellent condition Throughout</li>\n <li>Management fees C. 1600 per annum</li>\n <li>Fantastic City Centre location</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early Viewing is highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
